---
/** 博客正文图片：点击放大；组图自动左右切换；支持滚轮/按钮/双指缩放与拖拽平移 */
---

<div class="blog-zoom" id="blog-zoom" hidden>
	<div class="blog-zoom__controls">
		<button class="blog-zoom__close" type="button" aria-label="关闭">&times;</button>
		<button type="button" class="blog-zoom__btn" data-action="zoom-in" aria-label="放大">+</button>
		<button type="button" class="blog-zoom__btn" data-action="zoom-out" aria-label="缩小">−</button>
		<span class="blog-zoom__scale" data-scale>100%</span>
		<button type="button" class="blog-zoom__btn blog-zoom__btn--reset" data-action="reset" aria-label="重置缩放">↺</button>
	</div>
	<button type="button" class="blog-zoom__nav blog-zoom__nav--prev" data-nav="prev" aria-label="上一张" hidden>‹</button>
	<button type="button" class="blog-zoom__nav blog-zoom__nav--next" data-nav="next" aria-label="下一张" hidden>›</button>
	<span class="blog-zoom__counter" data-counter hidden></span>
	<p class="blog-zoom__hint" data-hint>滚轮缩放 · 拖拽平移 · Esc 关闭</p>
	<div class="blog-zoom__viewport" data-viewport>
		<img class="blog-zoom__img" data-img src="" alt="" draggable="false" />
	</div>
</div>

<script>
	function initBlogImageZoom() {
		const zoomEl = document.getElementById('blog-zoom') as HTMLElement | null;
		if (!zoomEl) return;

		const overlay = zoomEl;

		const viewport = overlay.querySelector('[data-viewport]') as HTMLElement;
		const img = overlay.querySelector('[data-img]') as HTMLImageElement;
		const scaleLabel = overlay.querySelector('[data-scale]') as HTMLElement;
		const closeBtn = overlay.querySelector('.blog-zoom__close') as HTMLButtonElement;
		const prevBtn = overlay.querySelector('[data-nav="prev"]') as HTMLButtonElement;
		const nextBtn = overlay.querySelector('[data-nav="next"]') as HTMLButtonElement;
		const counterEl = overlay.querySelector('[data-counter]') as HTMLElement;
		const hintEl = overlay.querySelector('[data-hint]') as HTMLElement;

		if (!viewport || !img || !scaleLabel || !closeBtn || !prevBtn || !nextBtn || !counterEl || !hintEl) return;

		const MIN_SCALE = 0.5;
		const MAX_SCALE = 5;
		const SCALE_STEP = 0.2;

		type GalleryItem = { src: string; alt: string };

		let scale = 1;
		let translateX = 0;
		let translateY = 0;
		let isDragging = false;
		let dragStartX = 0;
		let dragStartY = 0;
		let dragOriginX = 0;
		let dragOriginY = 0;
		let pinchStartDistance = 0;
		let pinchStartScale = 1;
		let bound = false;
		let gallery: GalleryItem[] = [];
		let galleryIndex = 0;

		function applyTransform() {
			img.style.transform = `translate(${translateX}px, ${translateY}px) scale(${scale})`;
			scaleLabel.textContent = `${Math.round(scale * 100)}%`;
			viewport.classList.toggle('is-draggable', scale > 1);
		}

		function resetTransform() {
			scale = 1;
			translateX = 0;
			translateY = 0;
			applyTransform();
		}

		function updateChrome() {
			const multi = gallery.length > 1;
			// 左右切换只在多图时出现；单图显示缩放按钮
			prevBtn.hidden = !multi;
			nextBtn.hidden = !multi;
			counterEl.hidden = !multi;
			overlay.querySelectorAll('[data-action], [data-scale]').forEach((node) => {
				(node as HTMLElement).hidden = multi;
			});
			if (multi) {
				counterEl.textContent = `${galleryIndex + 1} / ${gallery.length}`;
				hintEl.textContent = '← → 切换 · Esc 关闭';
			} else {
				counterEl.textContent = '';
				hintEl.textContent = '滚轮缩放 · 拖拽平移 · Esc 关闭';
			}
		}

		function showCurrent() {
			const item = gallery[galleryIndex];
			if (!item) return;
			img.src = item.src;
			img.alt = item.alt;
			resetTransform();
			updateChrome();
		}

		function openGallery(items: GalleryItem[], startIndex: number) {
			gallery = items;
			galleryIndex = Math.max(0, Math.min(startIndex, items.length - 1));
			showCurrent();
			overlay.hidden = false;
			document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
		}

		function close() {
			overlay.hidden = true;
			img.removeAttribute('src');
			document.body.style.overflow = '';
			gallery = [];
			galleryIndex = 0;
			updateChrome();
			resetTransform();
		}

		function go(delta: number) {
			if (gallery.length <= 1) return;
			galleryIndex = (galleryIndex + delta + gallery.length) % gallery.length;
			showCurrent();
		}

		function setScale(next: number) {
			scale = Math.min(MAX_SCALE, Math.max(MIN_SCALE, next));
			applyTransform();
		}

		function collectGallery(el: HTMLImageElement): { items: GalleryItem[]; index: number } {
			// 展示框内（data-gallery）视为一组，自动左右切换；否则按单图预览
			const group = el.closest('[data-gallery]') as HTMLElement | null;
			const nodes = group
				? Array.from(group.querySelectorAll('img'))
				: [el];

			const items = nodes.map((node) => {
				const image = node as HTMLImageElement;
				return {
					src: image.currentSrc || image.src,
					alt: image.alt || '',
				};
			});

			const index = nodes.indexOf(el);
			return { items, index: index >= 0 ? index : 0 };
		}

		function bindContentImages() {
			document.querySelectorAll('.post.article .content img').forEach((node) => {
				const el = node as HTMLImageElement;
				if (el.dataset.zoomBound === 'true') return;
				el.dataset.zoomBound = 'true';
				el.classList.add('blog-content-img');
				el.setAttribute('draggable', 'false');
				el.addEventListener('click', () => {
					const { items, index } = collectGallery(el);
					openGallery(items, index);
				});
			});
		}

		function onPointerDown(e: PointerEvent) {
			if (gallery.length > 1 || scale <= 1) return;
			isDragging = true;
			dragStartX = e.clientX;
			dragStartY = e.clientY;
			dragOriginX = translateX;
			dragOriginY = translateY;
			viewport.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);
		}

		function onPointerMove(e: PointerEvent) {
			if (!isDragging) return;
			translateX = dragOriginX + (e.clientX - dragStartX);
			translateY = dragOriginY + (e.clientY - dragStartY);
			applyTransform();
		}

		function onPointerUp(e: PointerEvent) {
			if (!isDragging) return;
			isDragging = false;
			viewport.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId);
		}

		function onWheel(e: WheelEvent) {
			if (overlay.hidden || gallery.length > 1) return;
			e.preventDefault();
			const delta = e.deltaY > 0 ? -SCALE_STEP : SCALE_STEP;
			setScale(scale + delta);
		}

		function getTouchDistance(touches: TouchList) {
			const dx = touches[0].clientX - touches[1].clientX;
			const dy = touches[0].clientY - touches[1].clientY;
			return Math.hypot(dx, dy);
		}

		function onTouchStart(e: TouchEvent) {
			if (gallery.length > 1 || e.touches.length !== 2) return;
			e.preventDefault();
			pinchStartDistance = getTouchDistance(e.touches);
			pinchStartScale = scale;
		}

		function onTouchMove(e: TouchEvent) {
			if (gallery.length > 1 || e.touches.length !== 2 || pinchStartDistance === 0) return;
			e.preventDefault();
			const distance = getTouchDistance(e.touches);
			setScale(pinchStartScale * (distance / pinchStartDistance));
		}

		function onTouchEnd() {
			pinchStartDistance = 0;
		}

		if (!bound) {
			bound = true;

			closeBtn.addEventListener('click', close);

			overlay.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
				if (e.target === overlay) close();
			});

			viewport.addEventListener('click', (e) => e.stopPropagation());

			prevBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
				e.stopPropagation();
				go(-1);
			});

			nextBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
				e.stopPropagation();
				go(1);
			});

			overlay.querySelectorAll('[data-action]').forEach((btn) => {
				btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
					e.stopPropagation();
					if (gallery.length > 1) return;
					const action = (btn as HTMLElement).dataset.action;
					if (action === 'zoom-in') setScale(scale + SCALE_STEP);
					if (action === 'zoom-out') setScale(scale - SCALE_STEP);
					if (action === 'reset') resetTransform();
				});
			});

			viewport.addEventListener('pointerdown', onPointerDown);
			viewport.addEventListener('pointermove', onPointerMove);
			viewport.addEventListener('pointerup', onPointerUp);
			viewport.addEventListener('pointercancel', onPointerUp);
			viewport.addEventListener('wheel', onWheel, { passive: false });
			viewport.addEventListener('touchstart', onTouchStart, { passive: false });
			viewport.addEventListener('touchmove', onTouchMove, { passive: false });
			viewport.addEventListener('touchend', onTouchEnd);

			document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
				if (overlay.hidden) return;
				if (e.key === 'Escape') {
					close();
					return;
				}
				if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
					e.preventDefault();
					go(-1);
				}
				if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') {
					e.preventDefault();
					go(1);
				}
			});
		}

		bindContentImages();
	}

	document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', initBlogImageZoom);
</script>

<style is:global>
	.post.article .content img.blog-content-img {
		display: block;
		max-width: 100%;
		max-height: 70vh;
		width: auto;
		height: auto;
		margin: 1.25rem auto;
		object-fit: contain;
		cursor: zoom-in;
		transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
	}

	.post.article .content img.blog-content-img:hover {
		opacity: 0.92;
	}

	/* 文章内图片展示框：组图网格 */
	.post.article .content .blog-gallery {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
		gap: 12px;
		margin: 1.5rem 0;
		padding: 12px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12));
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: var(--color-999, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03));
	}

	.post.article .content .blog-gallery img.blog-content-img {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: none;
		max-height: 220px;
		margin: 0;
		border-radius: 8px;
		object-fit: cover;
	}

	@media (max-width: 576px) {
		.post.article .content .blog-gallery {
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
			gap: 8px;
			padding: 8px;
		}

		.post.article .content .blog-gallery img.blog-content-img {
			max-height: 140px;
		}
	}
</style>

<style>
	.blog-zoom {
		position: fixed;
		inset: 0;
		z-index: 10000;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.92);
	}

	.blog-zoom[hidden] {
		display: none;
	}

	.blog-zoom__controls {
		position: absolute;
		top: 16px;
		right: 16px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 8px;
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		z-index: 2;
	}

	.blog-zoom__close {
		border: none;
		background: transparent;
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 32px;
		line-height: 1;
		cursor: pointer;
		padding: 0 4px;
		width: 36px;
		height: 36px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
	}

	.blog-zoom__close:hover {
		opacity: 0.75;
	}

	.blog-zoom__btn {
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 18px;
		line-height: 1;
		cursor: pointer;
	}

	.blog-zoom__btn:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
	}

	.blog-zoom__btn--reset {
		font-size: 16px;
	}

	.blog-zoom__scale {
		min-width: 36px;
		text-align: center;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
		font-size: 12px;
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		line-height: 1;
		padding: 2px 0;
	}

	.blog-zoom__nav {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
		z-index: 2;
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		border: none;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
		color: #fff;
		font-size: 36px;
		line-height: 1;
		cursor: pointer;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
	}

	.blog-zoom__nav[hidden],
	.blog-zoom__counter[hidden],
	.blog-zoom__btn[hidden],
	.blog-zoom__scale[hidden] {
		display: none !important;
	}

	.blog-zoom__nav:hover {
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
	}

	.blog-zoom__nav--prev {
		left: 16px;
	}

	.blog-zoom__nav--next {
		right: 16px;
	}

	.blog-zoom__counter {
		position: absolute;
		top: 20px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		z-index: 2;
		padding: 6px 12px;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
		font-size: 13px;
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
		backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.blog-zoom__hint {
		position: absolute;
		bottom: 20px;
		left: 50%;
		transform: translateX(-50%);
		margin: 0;
		color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
		font-size: 12px;
		pointer-events: none;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.blog-zoom__viewport {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		overflow: hidden;
		touch-action: none;
		cursor: default;
	}

	.blog-zoom__viewport.is-draggable {
		cursor: grab;
	}

	.blog-zoom__viewport.is-draggable:active {
		cursor: grabbing;
	}

	.blog-zoom__img {
		max-width: min(92vw, 100%);
		max-height: 82vh;
		object-fit: contain;
		transform-origin: center center;
		transition: transform 0.05s linear;
		user-select: none;
		-webkit-user-drag: none;
	}

	@media (max-width: 576px) {
		.blog-zoom__hint {
			display: none;
		}

		.blog-zoom__nav {
			width: 40px;
			height: 40px;
			font-size: 28px;
		}

		.blog-zoom__nav--prev {
			left: 8px;
		}

		.blog-zoom__nav--next {
			right: 8px;
		}
	}
</style>
